 2
 ```
 
+Similarly to validators, you can also define a converter using a decorator:
+
+```{doctest}
+>>> @define
+... class C:
+...     x = field()
+...     @x.converter
+...     def _parse_x(value):
+...         return int(value)
+>>> C("1").x
+1
+```
+
 Converters are run *before* validators, so you can use validators to check the final form of the value.
 
 ```{doctest}
